{"unit_id": "AndroidSix__dsh-computer-use-ng#card-zh", "repo": "AndroidSix/dsh-computer-use-ng", "commit": "e7fb6d7f8dbff6d635ce823834d601fb14452ee1", "type": "card", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-computer-use-ng 是为 DeepSeek Harness 提供桌面交互能力的插件，可让 Agent 观察窗口和界面元素，并通过 cua-driver 执行桌面操作。它向 DSH 注册屏幕观察、区域放大、鼠标点击、文本输入、按键、滚动、拖拽、等待以及应用枚举和启动等工具。观察支持 AX 元素树、当前模型直接读取截图和视觉观察者模式；动作可用观察结果中的元素编号或窗口坐标定位。它适合需要让 DSH Agent 操作桌面应用、网页窗口或辅助技术元素的场景。运行需要本地桌面环境和 cua-driver；GLM 视觉回退可选，Harness 视觉模型也可提供观察能力。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:155-208", "index.js:227-340", "lib/observe.js:202-290", "lib/actions.js:145-291"]}
{"unit_id": "AndroidSix__dsh-computer-use-ng#card-en", "repo": "AndroidSix/dsh-computer-use-ng", "commit": "e7fb6d7f8dbff6d635ce823834d601fb14452ee1", "type": "card", "lang": "en", "text": "dsh-computer-use-ng adds tools for DSH agents to observe desktop windows and operate them through cua-driver. It supports accessibility trees, screenshots, clicks, typing, keys, scrolling, dragging, and app launch. A local desktop and driver are required; GLM vision fallback is optional.", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:155-208", "index.js:227-340", "lib/observe.js:202-290", "lib/actions.js:145-291"]}
