{"unit_id": "AndroidSix__dsh-computer-use-ng#feature-1", "repo": "AndroidSix/dsh-computer-use-ng", "commit": "e7fb6d7f8dbff6d635ce823834d601fb14452ee1", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-computer-use-ng 的功能「屏幕观察」：读取目标窗口的可访问性元素、坐标和窗口信息，也可选择视觉观察或返回截图。通过 screen_observe 选择窗口、模式和元素过滤条件。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/observe.js:202-290"]}
{"unit_id": "AndroidSix__dsh-computer-use-ng#feature-2", "repo": "AndroidSix/dsh-computer-use-ng", "commit": "e7fb6d7f8dbff6d635ce823834d601fb14452ee1", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-computer-use-ng 的功能「区域放大」：截取目标窗口的局部区域并以图片返回，便于查看小字或细节。通过 screen_zoom 提供窗口标识和区域坐标。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:208-225"]}
{"unit_id": "AndroidSix__dsh-computer-use-ng#feature-3", "repo": "AndroidSix/dsh-computer-use-ng", "commit": "e7fb6d7f8dbff6d635ce823834d601fb14452ee1", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-computer-use-ng 的功能「桌面动作」：按观察到的元素编号或窗口坐标点击、双击、右键、输入文本、发送按键、滚动和拖拽。各动作作为独立 DSH 工具调用。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/actions.js:145-270"]}
{"unit_id": "AndroidSix__dsh-computer-use-ng#feature-4", "repo": "AndroidSix/dsh-computer-use-ng", "commit": "e7fb6d7f8dbff6d635ce823834d601fb14452ee1", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-computer-use-ng 的功能「应用管理」：列出正在运行的应用，或按应用名称和 bundle id 启动应用；可指定是否将窗口置前。通过 app_list 和 app_launch 调用。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/actions.js:279-306"]}
